{"title": "Elixir Table", "pageid": 14434, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Elixir_Table", "categories": ["Drop tables", "Leveled drop tables", "Potion drop tables"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <b>Elixir Table</b>, also known as <code>Alchemy_Potion_Elixir</code>&nbsp;<span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Alchemy_Potion_Elixir+type:treasuretable\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Alchemy_Potion_Elixir+type:treasuretable\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>, is a leveled <a href=\"/wiki/Treasure_Table\" title=\"Treasure Table\">Treasure Table</a> containing most of the elixirs that can be dropped.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Drops\">Drops</span></h2>\n<p><i>The following section can be transcluded into other pages with <code>{{:Elixir Table}}</code>.</i>\n</p>\n<i>The following is a list of all elixirs that can be dropped from <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Elixir Table</a>. See <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Elixir Table</a> for a detailed breakdown.</i><table class=\"wikitable sortable\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th colspan=\"2\">Item</th>\n  <th>Quantity</th>\n</tr>\n\n<tr><td colspan=\"4\" style=\"text-align:center\">All levels</td></tr>\n<tr>\n\n\n<th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 0.4rem\" colspan=\"2\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation\" title=\"Elixir of Arcane Cultivation\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/ELX_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-ELX_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb